#!/bin/bash
# Post-install setup for Fedora Atomic (Sway spin)
# This runs once via chezmoi. For steps requiring SynologyDrive,
# run ~/SynologyDrive/PostInstall/post-synology-setup.sh after sync.

set -euo pipefail

echo "=== Fedora Atomic Post-Install Setup ==="

# --- Third-party repos ---

# 1Password
if [[ ! -f /etc/yum.repos.d/1password.repo ]]; then
    echo "Adding 1Password repo..."
    sudo rpm --import https://downloads.1password.com/linux/keys/1password.asc
    sudo tee /etc/yum.repos.d/1password.repo > /dev/null <<'EOF'
[1password]
name=1Password Stable Channel
baseurl=https://downloads.1password.com/linux/rpm/stable/$basearch
enabled=1
gpgcheck=1
gpgkey="https://downloads.1password.com/linux/keys/1password.asc"
EOF
fi

# --- Layered packages ---

LAYERED_PACKAGES=(distrobox pam-u2f tailscale yubikey-manager zsh)
MISSING_PACKAGES=()

for pkg in "${LAYERED_PACKAGES[@]}"; do
    if ! rpm -q "$pkg" &>/dev/null; then
        MISSING_PACKAGES+=("$pkg")
    fi
done

if [[ ${#MISSING_PACKAGES[@]} -gt 0 ]]; then
    echo "Installing layered packages: ${MISSING_PACKAGES[*]}"
    sudo rpm-ostree install --idempotent "${MISSING_PACKAGES[@]}"
    echo "NOTE: A reboot may be required for layered packages to take effect."
fi

# 1Password (local package, installed separately)
if ! rpm -q 1password &>/dev/null; then
    echo "Installing 1Password..."
    sudo rpm-ostree install --idempotent 1password
fi

# --- Default shell ---

if [[ "$(getent passwd "$USER" | cut -d: -f7)" != "/usr/bin/zsh" ]]; then
    echo "Setting default shell to zsh..."
    sudo usermod -s /usr/bin/zsh "$USER"
fi

# --- Flatpaks ---

if ! flatpak list --app --columns=application | grep -q com.synology.SynologyDrive; then
    echo "Installing Synology Drive..."
    flatpak install -y flathub com.synology.SynologyDrive
fi

# --- Fonts ---

FONT_DIR="$HOME/.local/share/fonts"
mkdir -p "$FONT_DIR"

# Symbols Nerd Font (not in SynologyDrive, download from GitHub)
if ! fc-list | grep -q "Symbols Nerd Font"; then
    echo "Installing Symbols Nerd Font..."
    curl -fsSL -o /tmp/NerdFontsSymbolsOnly.tar.xz \
        "https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts/releases/latest/download/NerdFontsSymbolsOnly.tar.xz"
    tar -xf /tmp/NerdFontsSymbolsOnly.tar.xz -C "$FONT_DIR/"
    rm /tmp/NerdFontsSymbolsOnly.tar.xz
fi

# Noto Nerd Fonts (from SynologyDrive - skip if not synced yet)
if [[ -d "$HOME/SynologyDrive/Graphics/NotoSans" ]]; then
    if ! fc-list | grep -q "NotoMono Nerd Font"; then
        echo "Installing Noto Nerd Fonts from SynologyDrive..."
        cp "$HOME/SynologyDrive/Graphics/NotoSans/"*.ttf "$FONT_DIR/"
    fi
else
    echo "SKIP: Noto Nerd Fonts (SynologyDrive not synced yet)"
    echo "  Re-run or manually: cp ~/SynologyDrive/Graphics/NotoSans/*.ttf ~/.local/share/fonts/"
fi

# Rebuild font cache
fc-cache -f

# --- Desktop appearance ---

echo "Setting dark mode..."
gsettings set org.gnome.desktop.interface color-scheme 'prefer-dark'

# --- Enable user systemd timers ---

echo "Enabling user systemd timers..."
systemctl --user daemon-reload
systemctl --user enable --now daily-dev-summary.timer 2>/dev/null || true
systemctl --user enable --now distrobox-backup.timer 2>/dev/null || true
systemctl --user enable --now home-backup.timer 2>/dev/null || true

# --- Summary ---

echo ""
echo "=== Setup Complete ==="
echo ""
echo "Remaining manual steps:"
echo "  1. Reboot if layered packages were installed"
echo "  2. Set up & sync SynologyDrive, then run:"
echo "     ~/SynologyDrive/PostInstall/post-synology-setup.sh"
echo "  3. Restore distrobox containers:"
echo "     ~/SynologyDrive/PostInstall/distrobox-restore.sh tools"
echo "     ~/SynologyDrive/PostInstall/distrobox-restore.sh talos"
echo "  4. gh auth login"
echo "  5. See ~/SynologyDrive/PostInstall/POST_INSTALL.md for additional logins"
